# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# A World Made Just For Her — environment variables (copy to .env.local)
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Everything prefixed with VITE_ is PUBLIC: it is baked into the static bundle
# that GitHub Pages serves. NEVER put an API key or any secret in a VITE_ var.
# The Gemini API key lives ONLY in Cloudflare as the Worker secret GEMINI_API_KEY.

# Optional: base path override for local production builds.
# CI computes this automatically from the repository name.
# VITE_BASE_PATH=/game-for-bday-sarah/

# Optional: public URL of YOUR Cloudflare Worker (see proxy/README.md).
# The game calls  <this URL>/chat . When empty, Prince Fareed uses the
# built-in offline replies instead of Gemini.
# VITE_AI_PROXY_URL=https://fareed-ai-proxy.YOUR-ACCOUNT.workers.dev
